===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|sculpture}} A carved object.
#: {{ux|en|The '''carvings''' on the oak panels were ancient.}}
# The act or craft of producing a carved object.
#: {{ux|en|He took up '''carving''' after his retirement.}}
#: {{ux|en|My father is an expert in '''carving''', so we let him handle Christmas dinner.}}

